@startuml Refund Flow

title Refund Flow\nFrom request through review, processing, and resolution

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BorderColor #EF6C00
    FontColor #BF360C
    ArrowColor #37474F
    FontSize 14
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

[*] --> RefundRequested

RefundRequested --> RefundUnderReview : Validate refund conditions
RefundUnderReview --> RefundApproved : Refund allowed
RefundUnderReview --> RefundRejected : Refund not allowed

RefundApproved --> RefundProcessing : Send refund to payment service
RefundProcessing --> Refunded : Refund successful
RefundProcessing --> RefundFailed : Refund failed

RefundFailed --> RefundProcessing : Retry refund
RefundFailed --> ManualReview : Retry limit reached

Refunded --> [*]
RefundRejected --> [*]
ManualReview --> [*]

@enduml
